---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE, waLink } from '../site';
---
<Legal title="Terms of Use" updated="22 October 2026" description={`Terms for using ${SITE.url}, the Naqsha Zameen dashboard and ${SITE.company} survey services.`}>
  <p>By using {SITE.url}, the Naqsha Zameen dashboard or our survey services, you agree to these terms.</p>

  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.company} provides digital land maps through the Naqsha Zameen dashboard, RTK land measurement, printed survey
    maps and drone imagery services in {SITE.region}.
  </p>

  <h2>Maps Are for Reference</h2>
  <p>
    Mouza, murabba and killa boundaries in the dashboard are digitised for reference and planning. They are not an
    official revenue record and do not replace demarcation by the revenue department. Satellite imagery may be out of
    date or slightly offset. Do not rely on the dashboard alone for legal or financial decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>Survey Services</h2>
  <p>
    Scope, price and delivery for RTK and drone surveys are agreed before each job. Survey accuracy depends on site and
    satellite conditions. Results describe the ground at the time of survey.
  </p>

  <h2>Accounts and Subscriptions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Accounts are personal. Sharing logins or exceeding device limits may lead to suspension.</li>
    <li>Subscriptions give access to the areas you selected for the period you paid for.</li>
    <li>Fees are shown before payment and are generally non-refundable once access is activated.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
  <p>
    Do not copy, resell, scrape or redistribute map data, attempt to break security, or use our services unlawfully.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
  <p>
    The website, dashboard software, map layers and our survey outputs are owned by {SITE.company} or its licensors.
    Printed maps and reports you purchase may be used for your own purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and Third-Party Links</h2>
  <p>
    The Website may display third-party advertisements and links. We are not responsible for the content or practices of
    third-party sites or advertisers.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, {SITE.company} is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of
    our maps or services. Our total liability for any service is limited to the amount you paid for it.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes and Contact</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version. Questions:
    <a href={waLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
